### 1. Get all dishes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes


### 2. Get one dish
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes/1


### 3. Get dishes for restaurant ID 1
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes?restaurantId=1


### 4. Create a dish successfully
POST http://localhost:3000/api/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "name": "Special Firfir",
  "priceSantim": 20000
}


### 5. Reject a dish for a restaurant that does not exist
POST http://localhost:3000/api/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 999,
  "name": "Invalid Restaurant Dish",
  "priceSantim": 15000
}
### 6. Get all orders
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders


### 7. Get pending orders
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders/pending


### 8. Filter by status
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders?status=Pending


### 9. Filter by area
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders?area=Bole


### 10. Test pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders?limit=5&offset=0


### 11. Test sorting
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders?sort=asc


### 12. Get one order
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders/1


### 13. Get orders for restaurant 1
GET http://localhost:3000/api/restaurants/1/orders


### 14. Get orders for nonexistent restaurant
GET http://localhost:3000/api/restaurants/99/orders


### 15. Update order status
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Preparing"
}


### 16. Reject invalid status
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Invalid"
}


### 17. Test maximum limit
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders?limit=999


### 18. Delete order
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/orders/12